  "description": "Starting points for Stereo Space for mixing down and mastering in many music styles and situations: club, festival, big room, home hi-fi, headphones, studio reference, radio and car, plus 32 music styles for streaming. Every preset sets its own width, depth, fullness, motion, mix and bass limit: tight and narrow for hard techno, hip-hop and metal, wide and airy for trance, synthwave, cinematic and ambient, natural stereo bass for acoustic and classical. A situation adds its own correction to the style, for example more room for a festival, a narrower and mono-safe image for radio and car, and a careful image for headphones.",
